{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":2827,"name":"Marko Petrlić","username":"Marko_Petrlic","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.availproject.org/marko_petrlic/{size}/940_2.png","created_at":"2025-04-25T12:31:24.544Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReport Author\u003c/strong\u003e: Marko from the Avail Technical Committee\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eExecution Block\u003c/strong\u003e: \u003ca href=\"https://avail.subscan.io/block/1274598\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eSubscan | Avail Block Details\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTechnical  Committee Proposal Block\u003c/strong\u003e: \u003ca href=\"https://avail.subscan.io/block/1261637\"\u003ehttps://avail.subscan.io/block/1261637\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTechnical Committee Consenus\u003c/strong\u003e: 5/5 singer \u003ca href=\"https://avail.subscan.io/tech/30?tab=votes\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eSubscan | Aggregate Substrate ecological network high-precision Web3 explorer\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIntroduction\u003c/strong\u003e:\u003cbr\u003e\nThis report provides transparency regarding the network changes executed on the Avail Mainnet, focusing on the Vector bridge updates.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe existing Vector bridge was not compatible with the upcoming Ethereum Pectra upgrade, so changes were necessary to ensure its functionality.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExecuted Changes\u003c/strong\u003e:\u003cbr\u003e\nInstead of using TelepathyX in our bridge process, we switched to SP1 Helios and added new extrinsics to the vector pallet to ensure that the Ethereum → Avail bridge continues to function after the Pectra upgrade is completed.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCode Modification\u003c/strong\u003e:\u003cbr\u003e\nPR: \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/availproject/avail/pull/689\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eHelios sp1 integration by 0xSasaPrsic · Pull Request #689 · availproject/avail · GitHub\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nPR: \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/availproject/avail/pull/713\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eAdd support for sp1 v4.0.0 by 0xSasaPrsic · Pull Request #713 · availproject/avail · GitHub\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMerits to the Network\u003c/strong\u003e:\u003cbr\u003e\nThe upgrade ensures seamless operation of the Vector bridge with the upcoming Ethereum Pectra upgrade.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThank you\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":1,"updated_at":"2025-04-25T12:31:57.938Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":73,"reads":18,"readers_count":17,"score":428.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":1680,"topic_slug":"transparency-report-17-runtime-upgrade-bridge-changes","display_username":"Marko Petrlić","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://avail.subscan.io/block/1274598","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Subscan | Avail Block Details","clicks":0},{"url":"https://avail.subscan.io/block/1261637","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Subscan | Avail Block Details","clicks":0},{"url":"https://github.com/availproject/avail/pull/689","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Helios sp1 integration by 0xSasaPrsic · Pull Request #689 · availproject/avail · GitHub","clicks":0},{"url":"https://github.com/availproject/avail/pull/713","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Add support for sp1 v4.0.0 by 0xSasaPrsic · Pull Request #713 · availproject/avail · GitHub","clicks":0},{"url":"https://avail.subscan.io/tech/30?tab=votes","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":2}],"moder